Authorization Rules

Public endpoints:

/api/v1/auth/**

Everything else:

Authenticated

Configuration:

http.authorizeHttpRequests(auth -> auth

        .requestMatchers(
                "/api/v1/auth/**"
        ).permitAll()

        .anyRequest()

        .authenticated()
);

Meaning:

Endpoint	                Authentication
/api/v1/auth/login	                No
/api/v1/auth/register	            No
/api/v1/products	                Yes
/api/v1/orders	                    Yes